section_fact(27, dual_degree, overview, "Dual Degree B.Tech. + M.Tech. (Computer Science & Engineering)", "Dual_Degree_B.tech_M.tech.pdf", 1, "Dual Degree B.Tech. + M.Tech. (Computer Science & Engineering) is a five-year (ten semesters) full-time integrated Bachelor and Masters programme.").
section_fact(28, dual_degree, course_structure, "Course Objectives", "Dual_Degree_B.tech_M.tech.pdf", 1, "The objective of this programme is to prepare skilled and capable professionals with a strong conceptual and practical background in Computer Science and Engineering. The department follows a unique up-to-date curriculum to equip students with strong analytical and technical skills as well as thorough knowledge of and expertise in the latest state-of- the-art techniques in Computer Science as well as in the interdisciplinary disciplines so that they can work competently in diverse areas including industry, teaching and research and development. Besides having a good mix of theoretical and lab-oriented computer science courses together with a reasonable amount of training/learning in the interdisciplinary domains, the programme has a project component which also provides an opportunity for students to work on research problems under the close supervision of faculty members so that they are equipped to work in leading industries, and international R&D institutions or pursue careers in top-ranking academia towards higher education and research.").
